    "summary.md": "# Recipe Box\n\nSave and browse home recipes by cuisine and effort.\n\n- **Target user:** Home cooks\n- **Build route:** compile\n- **Genome:** catalog\n- **Presentation:** table / directory\n- **Persistence:** browser-local storage\n- **Start:** `npm run dev` → http://localhost:3000\n\n## Planned verification journeys\n\n- Application loads and shows a useful empty state\n- Invalid recipe input shows validation without crashing\n- User can add a complete recipe and see it in recipes\n- recipes survive a page refresh\n- User can edit an existing recipe\n- User can search recipes\n- User can narrow recipes with a meaningful filter\n- recipes are grouped by a meaningful category or status\n- Requested derived values update from persisted records\n- User can delete an existing recipe\n"
  },
